 "Kota was supposed to see the Shiratori sisters, his childhood friends, for the first time in six years, but fate had other plans. When he woke up...\n\nHe find he'd become a hamster.\n\nThe three sisters are now his owners! There's Himari, the kind and reliable eldest one; Futaba, the straight-laced middle one who's obsessed with health; and Miyu, the youngest one who's a sassy.\n\nKota, or rather \"Hamta,\" his new name as a pet, was as confused by the situation as he was pleased with all the pampering.\n\nHowever, he noticed something. The sisters didn't seem to get along as well as they used to.\n\nWhat happened during the past six years?\n\nYou'll need to use your tiny paws and big heart as well as you can to uncover the truth and help bring them back together!", "summary": "I got reincarnated... as a hamster! My owners are three sisters: a charming cosplayer, a straight-laced and caring one, and one with a sharp tongue and a sweet side. I'm being showered in love... but who will I fall in love with?", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sweet-hamster-days", "videos": [{"id": 198982, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "-68o9TXZEJc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-68o9TXZEJc", "title": "\u300e\u30cf\u30e0\u30b3\u30a4-\u30cf\u30e0\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u306b\u8ee2\u751f\u3057\u305f\u50d5\u3068\u4e09\u59c9\u59b9\u306e\u7518\u3005\u306a\u65e5\u3005\u300f2026\u5e747\u6708\u306bSteam\u307b\u304b\u3067\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u6c7a\u5b9a\uff01\u90fd\u4e38\u7d17\u4e5f\u83ef\u306a\u3069\u4eba\u6c17\u30b0\u30e9\u30d3\u30a2\u30a2\u30a4\u30c9\u30eb\u3068\u306e\u7570\u8272\u30b3\u30e9\u30dc\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\uff01", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-68o9TXZEJc/sddefault.jpg"}], "game_localizations": [{"id": 44871, "name": "\u30cf\u30e0\u30b3\u30a4-\u30cf\u30e0\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u306b\u8ee2\u751f\u3057\u305f\u50d5\u3068\u4e09\u59c9\u59b9\u306e\u7518\u3005\u306a\u65e5\u3005-", "cover": {"id": 591003, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/coco0r.jpg"}, "region"